        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607560/extras/0e163089fe0e05652d2584167f223d34.poster.avif?t=1760624872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607560/extras/0e163089fe0e05652d2584167f223d34.webm?t=1760624872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607560/extras/0e163089fe0e05652d2584167f223d34.mp4?t=1760624872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, a gashapon machine spit out a different capsule, a ball that jumped into this playground in the sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your gashan ball through different platforms in 60 seconds, collect your coins and reach the checkpoint!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face low gravity, spikes and much more in this playground in the sky?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game elements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging platforms;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheerful and engaging soundtrack;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guaranteed fun for the whole family!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607560/extras/0e163089fe0e05652d2584167f223d34.poster.avif?t=1760624872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607560/extras/0e163089fe0e05652d2584167f223d34.webm?t=1760624872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607560/extras/0e163089fe0e05652d2584167f223d34.mp4?t=1760624872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, a gashapon machine spit out a different capsule, a ball that jumped into this playground in the sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your gashan ball through different platforms in 60 seconds, collect your coins and reach the checkpoint!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face low gravity, spikes and much more in this playground in the sky?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game elements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging platforms;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheerful and engaging soundtrack;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guaranteed fun for the whole family!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
